  "description": "IYAVUA crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R 3 m. Reported CIF formula moiety: Cl17 O18 Pr4 Sb12 5-,5(C6 H8 N1 1+). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr1B (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr1A (Pr) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.830-4.838 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 120.88-121.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (2-MepyH)5[Pr4Sb12O18Cl17].",
